      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the comparison about the goblins, but anyway, could you elaborate more on the surface treatment side? Specifically, how can I differentiate between a slip application and a true glaze using only macro-observations of these fragments? I'm particularly interested in how the interface between the slip and the body might look if the firing temperatures were inconsistent.",
